ane-ref writing or schema change is delivered by S1.\n\nBefore this head lands, reconcile the note's remaining S2/S3 wording questions raised in message4128: unreadable projection versus selector/record eligibility, new branch spelling versus historical shorthand, and source isolation versus operational reader rollback. If the clarification changes adopted semantics, obtain a concrete amended adoption first. These are clarity obligations, not permission to relax a boundary.\n\nCurrent source: [inventory implementation](internal/app/app.go@359b211cfe94e758db592d6e4e78c2f85c6c9c30:616), [cleanup protections](internal/app/worktree_landing.go@359b211cfe94e758db592d6e4e78c2f85c6c9c30:46).","body":{"branch":"request/lane-worktree-identity","conditions":"S1: deliver the governing design and read-only checkout association. Deliver the assigned adopted stage and its stated controls, current source/architecture reconciliation, independent exact-head review, guarded landing, push/CI and owned cleanup. Preserve the full parent outcome and all protected operational boundaries described in the request.","head":"359b211cfe94e758db592d6e4e78c2f85c6c9c30","stale_bases":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:0c874a64c0766504cda6d3da4733f1ca378b235b, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:2fe3893fa5f7834a0d0e26d70407710cf2af1826, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:64a889b38b2ef5aeba01d537e7221858a0131662, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:7a71886b58aae707adfad0e1f4f98e6f464c6577, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:a0c1f08bff46a3ce1e4cfca5ef4b108a72405bf4, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:a601bafd0a9e491a4a81ed23eacd0f2d287803fd, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:b035cfef4ca156fba09586ab10c1b9910a341b79 stale; describes a superseded world; retired bases: git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:00ded1b22f0